  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• See ‘Top Steak Tips!’ (below left). <br>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.<br>• Cut carrot and beetroot into fries.<br>• Place veggie fries on a lined oven tray. Drizzle <br>with olive oil, sprinkle over mixed sesame <br>seeds, season with salt and pepper and toss <br>to coat.<br>• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369df842dc4b928197e48e/step-95f7b500.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, halve snacking tomatoes <br>(see ingredients). </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369df842dc4b928197e48e/step-add69e10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base. <br>• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side. <br>• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369df842dc4b928197e48e/step-2dc71220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Sprinkle over a pinch of Middle Eastern seasoning on crumbed chick&#39;n. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369df842dc4b928197e48e/step-9e2f1730.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a second medium bowl, combine mixed salad <br>leaves, snacking tomatoes and a drizzle of <br>white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season <br>to taste. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369df842dc4b928197e48e/step-fd415140.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide Middle Eastern crumbed chick&#39;n, sesame veg fries and tomato garden salad between plates. • Serve with garlic sauce. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369df842dc4b928197e48e/step-a8eead50.jpg"
    }
  ]
